</surname><given-names>LF</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Epidural injections</article-title><source>Image-guided spine intervention</source><year>2003</year><publisher-loc>Philadelphia</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Saunders</publisher-name><fpage>99</fpage><lpage>126</lpage></element-citation></ref><ref id="B6"><label>6</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lew</surname><given-names>HL</given-names></name><name><surname>Coelho</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Chou</surname><given-names>LH</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Preganglionic approach to transforaminal epidural steroid injections</article-title><source>Am J Phys Med Rehabil</source><year>2004</year><volume>83</volume><fpage>378</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15100628</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><label>7</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Pfirrmann</surname><given-names>CW</given-names></name><name><surname>Oberholzer</surname><given-names>PA</given-names></name><name><surname>Zanetti</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Boos</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Trudell</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Resnick</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Selective nerve root blocks for the treatment of sciatica: evaluation of injection site and effectiveness-a study with patients and cadavers</article-title><source>Radiology</source><year>2001</year><volume>221</volume><fpage>704</fpage><lpage>711</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11719666</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><label>8</label><element-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sontag</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name></person-group><person-group pers